"P316622652" "You found agents from the mysterious Malta Group meeting with Crey, and prevented them from destroying some incriminating documents."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compund1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P37494840" "Take Evidence to Crimson"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3578427469" "No, no, no. I'm not the one to take the evidence to. Take it to Crimson. I won't say any more about him, but he's the person you need to talk to now. He should be on your map. Now get over there."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2604498420" "Get that evidence back from {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P438338442" "Hello, {HeroName}. Call me Crimson. Not 'Agent Crimson', or 'Mr. Crimson'; just 'Crimson' will be fine. Indigo told me to expect you. She thinks you'll be able to handle a lot of the things that are outside of our own ability. Me, I'm not so sure, but I'm willing to trust her. You'll be working with Indigo for now, maybe you'll be working with me later. <br><br>You know, there is something you can do for me right now. We have mutual 'Friends' who have just become much more aware of you. I need you to hold their attention for a little while, and I have just the job to do it. Our mutual friends are about to make a man disappear, permanently. I can't tell you why, but let's just say that he could have a very interesting story to tell Congress one day. <br><br>Oh, and thank you, {HeroName}. I'll take that evidence. Don't you worry. It'll go where it needs to get to."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compund1_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3946465608" "Stop the assassination"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4129801992" "Crimson likes seeing stray threads play out. He seemed to like you, maybe you'll work with him more later. For now, saving that man is probably the best thing to do."
