// ModelDisplayName :
"P772743725" "Assassination victim"
// Description :
"P1419972161" "Stop the assassination!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P856364347" ""
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3419847029" "{Rescuer}? I guess I'm just lucky. Look, I gotta get out of here, but thank you. Thank you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1180929874" "You prevented the assassination Crimson warned you about."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4005737603" "I think you had a pretty good day, {HeroName}. Not so bad a way to get started working with mystery people, huh? You hurt Crey and saved a man's life, and that's just the start. If you want to keep working with me, I'm sure that there will be many, many more things to do."
// RandomFameString :
"P1295088397" "Crey took a major beating in court after that briefcase of evidence showed up."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1029848893" "I'm looking for someone, {HeroName}, and I think you can help me. Only I know exactly where this person is, and that's the reason I need you to find him. He works for those mutual friends of ours, and goes by the code name Eagle Green. What those friends don't know is that he has a second employer whom he still works for under the name Lt. Westley Strauss. Also unbeknownst to them, but beknownst to me, Mr. Strauss is about to report to that alternate employer right now. Since this alternate employer is the Nemesis Army, I think it could be bad if he's allowed to tell them all that they want to know. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>So, I want you to capture Mr. Strauss and prevent the Nemesis Army from getting a hold inside the Malta Group.</A> <br><br>Let me warn you, though, there won't be much time to pull this off. You'll have maybe 90 minutes before Mr. Strauss takes off."
// AcceptString :
"P2261910617" "Capture Mr. Strauss and prevent the Nemesis Army from getting a hold inside the Malta Group"
// SendOffString :
"P503671328" "I've got the spot all laid out for you. It probably won't be anything too posh, but it should be very well protected by Nemesis Army forces. Your target is Westley Strauss and whomever else is involved in his case. Now all you have to do is get there, fight or sneak your way past a platoon or three of the Nemesis Army, and wrap up Mr. Strauss. Easy!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1984655009" "Defeat Strauss & his handlers"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P450708199" "All you have to do is get to the spot I've marked, fight or sneak your way past a platoon or three of the Nemesis Army, and wrap up Mr. Strauss in about 90 minutes. Easy!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1386776952" "Indigo's information is infallible as always. This innocuous office isn't innocent, but is actually a staging ground for the Nemesis Army."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1688193730" "Westley  Strauss"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P76520638" "Well, you tell them that I think I've been discovered. I'm starting to wonder who I'm supposed to be a double agent for!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2729329236" "In a way I'm glad to see you, {HeroName}. At least with you heroes, I know where I stand."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2321453266" "You captured Westley Strauss and prevented the Nemesis Army from learning anything."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1648999746" "You were unable to complete the operation in time. The Nemesis Army learned something from Strauss."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P828713683" "Very well done, {HeroName}. The Nemesis Army likes to get their hands into everything, and the last thing I want is for them to start trying to manipulate another major group. Whether they succeed or are discovered, everyone else would lose in the end."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1183157320" "I could chew you out about this, but that wouldn't really be fair. You're the one I'm asking for help, after all. Look, you know how bad Nemesis is, right? Well, the last thing I want is for him to start manipulating another big group. This is going to be more work for me and Crimson laying counter-intel, but, maybe we can salvage this. Having a hero of your stature show up at the start of this could even make it look more legitimate. So maybe this can work out in the end. <br>It'll just be a bunch of long nights full of constant danger. <br>Potential grisly death. <br>Possible capture and torture. <br>Easy! And then it should work out. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable SURVIVING_HERO :
"P194914344" "Ms. Liberty"
// Script Variable SURVIVING_HERO :
"P3549633783" "The Brawler"
// Script Variable SURVIVING_HERO :
"P2167503126" "Positron"
// Script Variable SURVIVING_HERO :
"P2392409874" "Synapse"
// Script Variable SURVIVING_HERO :
"P1756859898" "Penelope Yin"
// Script Variable SURVIVING_HERO :
"P564358985" "Citadel"
// Script Variable SURVIVING_HERO :
"P1575607881" "Numina"
// Script Variable SURVIVING_HERO :
"P1088294622" "Manticore"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2410579763" "I can't tell you who and I can't tell you why, but our mutual friends are going to set a trap of sorts for an up and coming hero. They won't be out to hurt or kill her, just to badly discredit her. I hate that kind of thing. I may be a covert operative, but that doesn't mean I relish dirty tricks. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>So, since I know it's about to happen, I'd like you to stop them from smearing the good name of a rising hero.</A> <br><br>The timing on this is going to be tight, though. You have to stop this plan before the heroine arrives, because if she finds out about Malta right now, they may just kill her. She's pretty punctual, so you'll only have 90 minutes at the most."
// AcceptString :
"P4015728293" "Stop the Malta group from smearing the good name of a rising hero"
// SendOffString :
"P3061707183" "Here's the set-up: <br>Our young heroine's contact is about to get an anonymous tip that will send her to investigate a possible Sky Raider office invasion. When she gets there, Malta Group operatives are going to jump her, knock her out, and them make it look like she failed to stop a group of Skulls and got everyone in there killed. Any protest she makes about 'mysterious commandos' will be ridiculed as attempts to save her image. <br><br>Of course, what they don't know is that we know this is all about to happen. So, your goal is to rescue the people the Malta Group plans to kill, disarm the bombs they're using to cover their presence, and take out the commanding officer in charge of the operation. All before the heroine arrives on the scene in about an hour and a half. See? Easy!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4175043003" "Stop op leader & his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2918485906" "Don't get hung up fighting everybody! Your goal is to rescue the people Malta are going to kill, disarm the bombs they're using to cover their presence, and take out the commanding officer in charge of the operation. You have to do all of this before the heroine arrives on the scene in about an hour and a half. Easy!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P342130222" "As you rush to the scene, you have to wonder if you were on the receiving end of this kind of smear attack earlier in your career. Maybe there's another hero out there you owe your good name to."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P149279450" "We should have this rolled up in time to catch the game, unless something crazy happens."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3005044197" "C'mon. It's not like {HeroName}, or {SURVIVING_HERO}, or someone like that's gonna show up."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3299691543" "Oh, man. Forget I said anything. We have a situation here!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3702597931" "Once this is over, that heroine will be prime for recruitment."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1883137478" "I hear they tried the same thing on {HeroName} back at the start, but they were caught."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P513248043" "{HeroName}? Call the OpsLead! Tell him we have an MHI!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2806466968" "I've heard about these guys. We work with them, it's our ticket to the big time!"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P359354801" "Yeah, and we get payback on that uppity mask, too!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P720629745" "Oh man, that's {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2991641370" "Ocelot Alpha Male"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3068080587" "Watch team, say again? You spotted {HeroName}? That's impossible!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P979057737" "Ah, hell! All units, we have an MHI! Repeat, MHI!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3379930794" "Victim"
// Description :
"P1110978626" "victims to save"
