"P2020931920" "Bomb"
// Description :
"P2705714242" "bombs to disarm"
// SingularDescription :
"P1131762023" "Disarm the last bomb!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3701360090" "You begin disarming the bomb."
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P2557807414" "You have been interrupted!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1398268651" "You have disarmed the bomb."
// InteractActionString :
"P1388010237" "Disarming..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3451768346" "Through your stealthy interference, a young heroine's career has been saved."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1460647556" "Despite your best attempts, a young heroine's life was likely just ruined."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P120472108" "You may have saved more than lives today, {HeroName}, you may have saved someone's soul. Smear tactics like this are pretty popular in the Malta Group as a way to leave super-powered people down and desperate. That way they can later come in and pick up the pieces, recruiting the victim as an asset of the organization that just destroyed their career. They'll plant false evidence for blackmail, even threaten lives and loved ones. They like to leave you broken, then take you in, without ever revealing they're the ones who hurt you in the first place. The sick part is, they do all of this and they still think they're the good guys. I told you that you'd be fighting some very bad people if you helped me out."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2550867851" "This makes me so mad. Not at you, not at you. Those people think that they can ruin a heroine's life just because it will make her easier to recruit for Malta operations later. They'll plant false evidence for blackmail, even threaten lives and loved ones. They like to leave you broken, then take you in, without ever revealing they're the ones who hurt you in the first place. The sick part is, they do all of this and they still think they're the good guys. <br><br>Don't beat yourself up over this one, {HeroName}. Maybe that heroine will find a way back onto her feet. I'll see if I know anyone who can help her out. Maybe this won't have to be a loss in the end."
// RandomFameString :
"P2356124623" "It's horrible that those Skulls killed all of those people. I hear that the young heroine who failed to save them retired in shame."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1477905218" "I've got another job for you, {HeroName}. A very nasty bit of business that's sure to leave a lot of people dead and even more lives ruined. I can't tell you how I know about this, or who's involved, but the Knives of Artemis are about to do a bit of dirty work for their employers. The Knives have been hired to eliminate a small legal firm called Beecham & Becksley that has a fair bit of history. Their plan is to massacre everyone and then pin it on another group. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to stop the Knives of Artemis from massacring that law firm.</A> <br><br>The Knives work to a pretty tight time table, so you probably won't have more than 60 minutes to save that firm."
// AcceptString :
"P185196353" "Stop the Knives of Artemis from massacring a law firm"
// SendOffString :
"P1813035760" "The Knives of Artemis are top-notch mercenaries, {HeroName}. They're very brutal and they're very thorough, but they are mercenaries. So if they think the operation's going badly, they'll pull out. If you can upset their plans, it should disrupt their time table enough to make them quit the operation. In order to do that, you'll need to find the people they've rounded up and free them, and disarm the firebombs they're going to use to gut the place and cover their tracks. All in 60 minutes. Easy!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2909892334" "Disrupt Knives' attack"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P180583779" "The Knives will call the operation and retreat if you disturb their plans. You'll need to rescue the people they've rounded up and disarm their bombs."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2914202854" "No one else in this building seems to be aware of the Knives' attack. The law office of Beecham & Becksley was their only target, and they've struck with surgical precision."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P4280711778" "Keep the civvies in line until the big ending."
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P670209694" "Right. Anyone resists, kill them."
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P1391173497" "You're dead."
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P722928539" "I'll massacre you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2116446909" "They were just rounding us up. They wouldn't tell us anything."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P422037188" "I don't know what this was about, {Rescuer}, but I'm glad you came when you did!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P868120959" "They just burst down the doors and started attacking, {Rescuer}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Bombs 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P210272131" "You stopped the Knives of Artemis' attack and saved the law firm."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3490037289" "You were unable to stop the Knives of Artemis and save the law firm."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3341513918" "I'm glad you were able to save Beecham & Becksley, {HeroName}. They have a long history in the often obscure field of meta-human civil rights. That's not so big a deal these days, but that used to be quite a major issue. I can't tell you more than that, of course, but you did save a lot of lives today."
// RandomFameString :
"P4242712882" "I heard that you stopped a bunch of lawyers from being killed, {HeroName}, but no one will say a thing about who you were fighting."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2812343864" "Some of the lawyers made it out of the building, but there are still a few people missing. Even if they turn up later, I'm afraid Beecham & Becksley will never get back on its feet again. It's a sad ending to a firm with a history of standing up for meta-human rights."
// RandomFameString :
"P4177132612" "Did you hear about that law firm that was trashed? No one knows who did it, but I bet it was the Freakshow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3839512665" "I hate camping, {HeroName}. Personally, I don't get it. We've spent 10,000 years developing civilization, and people still like to go out and sleep in the woods. But some people do. And what I want you to do is stop someone from getting it while they're camping. The person in question is a reporter named Dan Irish. He's enjoying the great outdoors, and is about to be killed for getting a little too close to some nasty truths in a book he's working on. The killers are the Knives of Artemis. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to stop the assassination of Dan Irish.</A> You'll need to act fast, though. Dan's no woodsman, I'll be surprised if he can evade the Knives of Artemis for more than 2 hours."
// AcceptString :
"P3705962026" "Stop the assassination of Dan Irish"
// SendOffString :
"P1726623198" "Dan's book, 'As if by an Occult Hand: Secrets Behind the News' is going to be very interesting when it comes out, but it won't see the light of day if the Knives kill him. I've called for an emergency force field to be erected around the area where Dan's camping. That should help you find him quickly and get him out. There's a Light Rail stop near the preserve where he's staying; hopping a rail is your best bet at getting there in time."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P252241979" "Save Dan Irish from Knives"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P183713973" "You're on the clock, {HeroName}! You have to find Dan Irish before the Knives of Artemis kill him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LocationName :
"P3617766322" "Black Sands Nature Preserve"
// EntryString :
"P970673649" "This nature preserve is one of the few natural areas still open to the public within Paragon City."
// Script Variable MISSION_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4161364570" "No one interferes with our hunting!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2692356114" "Dan Irish"
// Description :
"P4202584843" "Find Dan Irish"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P56874775" "Who were those people, {Rescuer}?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1093510355" "You saved the reporter Dan Irish from the Knives of Artemis."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P247745836" "You failed to save the reporter Dan Irish from the Knives of Artemis."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P341936980" "You pulled it off, {HeroName}! Dan dodged the Knives thanks to you. He might actually live long enough to finish his book. I can't wait to see the faces of certain prominent persons in national government when that hits the shelves. I'm also glad to see you show up the Knives of Artemis. They always hate to lose, and I love to see it when they do."
// RandomFameString :
"P3313666205" "I heard that you saved the famous reporter Dan Irish, {HeroName}. I guess I should thank you when his next book comes out."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2909951781" "Well, Dan's disappeared. I'll see if any of my connections can find some trace of him, but I have to assume he's gone for good. <br><br>You tried to take the Knives on in one of their favorite environments, {HeroName}. You can't blame yourself. I've asked Crimson to recover Irish's notes. Even if he's dead, his notes could still help to hurt the bad guys."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3858773392" "I have a little something for you to do, {HeroName}. It's kind of complicated, but because of that it's really pretty simple. You see, certain mutual friends of ours are quite upset that some of their plans have been discovered, so they've decided to set a trap. However, I know that it's a trap, and I must assume that know that I know it's a trap. So really, it's more of an invitation. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>An invitation to an ambush.</A> Shall I send your RSVP?"
// AcceptString :
"P1858500042" "RSVP for an ambush"
// SendOffString :
"P1724452250" "Just so you know, they've set up a whole 'kidnapped celebrity' cover as the draw for you. There aren't any, so it's not something to worry about. However, there are a whole lot of dangerous people waiting to hurt you very badly. Your goal is simple: take them all out. Oh, and do play along some if you get the chance. That should help to really freak them out."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1359185744" "Defeat all ambushers"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P841473289" "Remember, there aren't actually any kidnapped celebrities or anything. Just a bunch of people who want to hurt you. Defeat all of them and you're done."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1374706927" "Since you know this ambush is coming, it doesn't seem like much of a surprise. "
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3330728311" "Sister Sestra"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2650855360" "They said {HeroName} was supposed to be here. Our time is their money."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1565237234" "You won't find any kidnapped movie stars here, {HeroName}. Just humiliating defeat."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3409148765" "Ice Cold Panther"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3562899370" "They're through the line. {HeroName} should be here soon. Get ready."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1465325853" "{HeroName}, at long last. I been waitin' for this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1624070048" "You defeated the trap that had been laid for you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2628591403" "Nice work, {HeroName}. While you were out springing the trap, I spent a bit of time planting confusing counter-evidence indicating that there was no way you could have known that was a trap. It should keep them running in circles for a while trying to figure out if they have a leak or if you've just been lucky. But then, that's part of the fun of dealing with these sorts of conspiratorial paranoids. Just give them a few clues and they'll invent all of your plots for you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compund7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3752870051" "I've discovered that something very bad is about to happen to a good person. Or maybe I should say, already has happened, but it's not too late to fix it. A Freedom Corp trainer has been taken by agents of the Malta Group. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You need to get him out of their hands.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P807854293" "Rescue Freedom Corp trainer from the Malta Group."
// SendOffString :
"P4171900820" "The trainer's name is Jason, but he might be acting a little out of it. You'll have to forgive him that, he's not really himself right now. You'll need to free him from Malta, and take out the agents in charge of the operation. They're being led by an operative code-named Cipher Grey. After you've done that, you'll need to talk to Crimson."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compund7_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1294429402" "Rescue Freedom Corp trainer"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P176583525" "After you've rescued Jason, you'll need to talk to Crimson. He may be able to tell you more."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3099072891" "This mission seems clear-cut, but something still troubles you. Indigo is usually mysterious at best, but you feel that there's more going on here than you know."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P557667319" "It's confirmed. The target is in our possession."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1555221624" "He walked right in, didn't even fight. I love this mind control stuff."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3416218087" "We have a Meta-Human Incursion! Repeat: We have an MHI!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2442584789" "There's an MHI reported. Watch your backs."
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P141287166" "I got the hero!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P1449155454" "I've got you in my sights!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P491132435" "Lantern Black Ultra"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2487566569" "Report again! Can you confirm the MHI? I repeat, can you confirm the MHI?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2256880640" "We got our confirmation. Meta-Human Incursion confirmed as {HeroName}. Fire at will!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3686794398" "Jason"
// Description :
"P4209025958" "Locate Freedom Corp trainer"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1608808982" "{Rescuer}? What am I doing here? Who are these people?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2690993501" "You rescued Jason, a Freedom Corp trainer who had been captured by agents of the Malta Group."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compund7_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1354424907" "Speak with Crimson"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2595229385" "Crimson has more details for you. I really can't tell you anything more until you talk to him."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P893388126" "Begin sanctioned action! Target is {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P974041908" "Good to see you again, {HeroName}. The man you rescued, and who I am about to send you to rescue again, is the victim of some pretty heinous work. Poor Jason is a good kid, who through no fault of his own, got tagged for 'forcible recruitment' by our mutual friends. They do that. Find ways to make people work for them. In his case, they used some invasive mental conditioning. 'Manchurian Candidate' stuff, processes developed back in the old CIA MK-Ultra experiments in the 60's and improved ever since. Jason was set up to gather information on every meta-human and paranormal he worked with and funnel it to his controllers. Information they could use to kill or control anyone they thought could be a threat. <br><br>The good news is that the conditioning starts to wear off after about a year. The bad news is that they know this, and have an implanted suggestion that makes the conditioned operative return for another session. <br><br>That's right, {HeroName}. Jason's headed back. This should be the last time, though."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compund7_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3077112924" "Save Jason from Malta Group"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4024448647" "Everything Crimson told you is true, {HeroName}. We won't ever lie to you. You need to keep Jason from returning to the Malta Group for another brain washing session."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3414159668" "Your interference has signed your death warrant, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1137527052" "According to Crimson, this is the location Jason will be drawn to. Now it's up to you to keep him from returning to the Malta Group and their mind control."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1625191940" "We have the pigeon in the pocket. And no sign of {HeroName} this time."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3690507450" "Why are you worried about {HeroName}? You got the briefing. {HeroName}'s MHI was a fluke."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3885435973" "A fluke, huh? We have a Meta-Human Incursion! It's {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P627385539" "Arc-Light Black Ultra"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2792400355" "{HeroName}. Of all the luck. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4098797645" "{Rescuer}? Didn't you just? What am I doing here? What the heck is going on?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P292321318" "You once again rescued Jason, a Freedom Corp trainer who was being controlled by the Malta Group. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3520838779" "You did a really good thing today, {HeroName}. Jason's missed his next control session, and now Malta thinks he's being watched too closely for another brainwashing attempt. He shouldn't have any more trouble, except for some bad dreams here and there. But I think we can both agree that's ok compared to the alternative."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compund8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MalteseLaptop 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2871950796" "The Maltese Laptop"
// DetailString :
"P451488185" "The files on this computer, while often encrypted, could be very disturbing when combined with enough information about the Malta Group's organization."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3419275951" "I've got another job for you, {HeroName}. It's a bit mean, but I'd like your help to do some very bad things to a very bad person, by doing bad things to other bad people. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>It's not the most pleasant mission, but if you're willing, I'd like your help to frame a despicable person for something he didn't do.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1954552472" "Frame a despicable person for something he didn't do"
// SendOffString :
"P3721393303" "I'm glad you'll help. The person in question is an agent for certain mutual friends of ours. He goes by the code-name Sunset Gold, and made his name killing troublesome heroes fighting criminal cartels in South America. Since he got picked up by Malta, he's been one of their top gunslingers. <br><br>He has access to a lot of top secret information, which, unknown to him, we also know. This puts Mr. Sunset in a unique and precarious position. If certain operations that only he knows about were compromised, Malta would be quick to point the finger at him. I'll point you to the first one, a raid on a government lab by the Knives of Artemis. If you can defeat them there, that's the first step. <br><br>While you're doing that, Crimson and I will work on our end of things. Crimson will brief you next."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compund8_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P215755118" "Defeat all Knives in lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4173233702" "Defeat all of the Knives of Artemis in that lab, that will be stage one. Then go talk to Crimson."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P655642518" "The Knives of Artemis have begun their attack, not knowing that their secret operation has already been compromised."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3748032454" "Lab worker"
// Description :
"P335303245" "lab workers to save"
// SingularDescription :
"P1980550985" "Save the last lab worker!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2434086798" "{Rescuer}! They attacked out of nowhere!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1844939911" "I think they were trying to steal our new fusion cell technology, {Rescuer}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4135655714" "This is a secret government facility, {Rescuer}! I'm happy to see you, but how could you even have known we were in trouble? "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P340916358" "You averted the Knives of Artemis' attack on the secret government lab, and now need to speak with Crimson."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compund8_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3921377414" "Talk to Crimson"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1983265809" "You did great on the first part, but there's more to come. Crimson will tell you the next step."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3711608948" "There's {HeroName}! You'll pay for stopping our mission!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2046154097" "Good job on the first stage, {HeroName}. Let me tell you about the next phase. Our friends are planning a little bit of wet work, an assassination. You don't need to know why, the important thing is that it's stopped very visibly. While you're doing that, Indigo and I will be taking our time to make sure that our friends make the connections we want them to make about our pal Sunset. <br><br>You concentrate on stopping up that assassination. Indigo and I will take care of our end. Talk to me again when you're done. In person."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compund8_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1749898289" "That assassination has to be stopped. Crimson will have another job for you after that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1683988331" "This is the location Crimson gave you. Signs of forced entry show that the Malta Group is likely already on the scene."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P636938128" "I was able to confirm it. {HeroName} decimated that operation by the Knives."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1560714107" "Who could be feeding that information to {HeroName}? That whole operation was top secret."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1839342806" "Forget about the Knives! {HeroName}'s found us!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P74628160" "Thank you, {Rescuer}! I hoped someone would come, but I thought it would be too late. I'll never recant my testimony, though, no matter how much they threaten me!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2620948684" "You stopped the assassination in time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compund8_Part4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3203173590" "Meet with Crimson"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2704180879" "Good work again, but you'll need to speak with Crimson. I think he has one last job for you."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3884596560" "There's {HeroName}. Time for some severe discouragement."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2470498835" "Now it's time for the final play. Sunset Gold is supposed to pick up some important documents at a drop off point. Indigo's set up a little surprise that should delay him. What you need to do is go in there and attempt to get those documents. You won't have a lot of time, maybe an hour, but it doesn't matter if you succeed or fail, just that you try. Meanwhile, I'll finish things up on our end. <br><br>By the time this is done, either we'll have the documents and Malta's board will think that Sunset's going to sell them to the top bidder, or he'll have them, but they'll think he's going to cut and run. Best of all, either way you have a decent cover story for any operation you've taken or will take against Malta Group assets. That's what we call 'Deniability'. And it all gets pinned on Sunset Gold. <br><br>Oh, and don't feel bad for ol' Sunset Gold. That low-down bushwackin' traitor lost any claim on sympathy five years ago in Columbia, when he buried one friend of mine too many."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compund8_Part5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2987848541" "Try to get Malta documents"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3338874502" "Like Crimson said, it doesn't really matter if you succeed or not. Either works for us. We already know everything in those secret documents anyway. A lot of this kind of work is about presenting your enemies with a story plausible enough for them to want to believe it."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P117902433" "We have located {HeroName}, and are moving in to neutralize target."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1266315362" "These offices are unused, but kept in working shape by a shell company to deflect attention."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2469414513" "Zeus Class Titan"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1873930256" "Security remains enforced."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P769918295" "MHI! Threat level extreme!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2717199723" "Sunset Gold had better be here soon."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1905462980" "Don't be too sure. Rumor is Gold was feeding info to {HeroName}."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4271838866" "{HeroName}! Gold must have told you where to strike!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Documents 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1264719891" "Desktop Computer"
// Description :
"P3522692695" "Find the documents"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3528387643" "You access the computer."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P977785347" "You finish accessing the computer."
// InteractActionString :
"P2096386660" "Accessing..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3293408010" "The documents are on this computer. You take the laptop with you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2581952707" "You found the documents."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3369923488" "You weren't able to find the documents, but you know that it didn't really matter."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P427860820" "Well, Sunset Gold showed up to get the documents in the end, only to find you'd already snagged them. He decided it was safer to run than try to explain himself to his bosses. They've branded him a traitor based on your work and our work, and want him for 'interrogation.' Ouch. I feel a bit bad for him. I'm not too big on dirty tricks, even if the target deserves it. Crimson's as close to happy with this ending as I've seen him in a long time. I have the feeling that he got a big dose of closure from this. <br><br>I know that, as a hero, you're were probably hoping for a big climactic battle against this mysterious Sunset Gold character, but those sorts of things don't happen so much in this end of the business. For what we do, this is a pretty solid wrap-up. You did the right things, saved lives, and hurt the bad guys. So, no regrets."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3115949319" "Well, Sunset Gold showed up to get the documents in the end, and is now on the run from Malta. They've branded him a traitor based on your work and our work, and want him for 'interrogation.' Ouch. I feel a bit bad for him. I'm not too big on dirty tricks, even if the target deserves it. Crimson's as close to happy with this ending as I've seen him in a long time. I have the feeling that he got a big dose of closure from this. <br><br>I know that, as a hero, you're were probably hoping for a big climactic battle against this mysterious Sunset Gold character, but those sorts of things don't happen so much in this end of the business. For what we do, this is a pretty solid wrap-up. You did the right things, saved lives, and hurt the bad guys. So, no regrets."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Mission9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Sisterhood 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4165352473" "The Sisterhood of the Huntress"
// DetailString :
"P3019119220" "This book illustrates rites and rituals for mystical ceremonies associated with a secret society called 'The Sisterhood of the Huntress.' A cursory examination shows elements of moon worship, ritualized hunting of human beings, and violent human sacrifices. Though the book is filled with hateful screeds against all men and any woman who is not a member of the Sisterhood, you can see evidence that it was probably twisted from the dogma of a once gentler fertility cult."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P262069477" "I have an investigation into some missing people for you, {HeroName}, and while I can't tell you many specifics this time, that's really more because I just don't know what's going on. The Knives of Artemis have been abducting people, seemingly at random. Men and women in positions of power, or just normal family folks who are grabbed by Knives and never seen again. I can't figure out why. It isn't part of any contracts I know of. The only lead I have is that the Knives occasionally request a few Malta soldiers as guards for something. I've traced where one group of guards went, and I'd like you to investigate. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>With some luck, you might even find the people kidnapped by the Knives of Artemis before anything happens to them.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3705028034" "Find the people kidnapped by the Knives of Artemis"
// SendOffString :
"P211009140" "I don't know why the Knives have picked these targets, but the people they take don't seem to come back. If there are any people there, find them and get them home."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3481167938" "Find people abducted by Knives"
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P184369895" "Do not undertake tasks against your betters, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3792906593" "These caves tunnel deep beneath the ground, but you spot telltale signs that others have passed this way recently."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P891403035" "Man, this 'Sisterhood of the Huntress' thing freaks me out. What are we even doing here?"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3152138796" "They asked for guards, they get guards. We don't ask questions, and we don't get freaked out by the answers."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P958445886" "That's {HeroName}! This just got complicated."
// Script Variable CEREMONY_INCANTING_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1456279388" "Sisters of the Huntress! We shall send our sacrifices to our cruel goddess!"
// Script Variable CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1734087075" "No outsider may see these rites and live!"
// Script Variable CEREMONY_INCANTING_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2566578240" "We are the Sisterhood of the Huntress! All others are our prey!"
// Script Variable CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3798101642" "You would dare to intrude, {HeroName}! You shall die!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3298402522" "Sister Hecate"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P698087038" "Soon my sisters, the sacrifices shall commence!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4271589810" "An outsider in our sacred rites! Slay {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1241907964" "Sacrificial victim"
// Description :
"P614646742" "victims to find"
// SingularDescription :
"P2564449086" "Save the last sacrificial victim!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2242471556" "They were going to kill me. They said my wife would be stronger if I was dead!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1753125307" "They said I was a 'usurper of the goddess's divine mysteries.' I'm a doctor! I help people!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P446703478" "They said they would take my life, my success, and wear it like a mask!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4226252880" "They said I led a weak life! Who are they to judge?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P263534445" "Those women said a lot of messed up things, {Rescuer}. I'll just be glad to be out of here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Altar 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P950630402" "Altar"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2331365257" "You begin examining the altar."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3473001305" "You finish examining the altar."
// InteractActionString :
"P1412195360" "Examining..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3821622762" "You found a book filled with ritual information on the altar."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3360767737" "You disrupted the rites of the Knives' cult and saved their victims from ritual sacrifice."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P873180050" "Let me make sure I understand this. You found a cult within the Knives of Artemis that's been performing human sacrifices? Okay, that's just weird. I don't know if this 'Sisterhood of the Huntress' is a new addition, or a tradition I just never heard about, but it's important that we now know it exists. I'll update Crimson, it may help make a few things fit together. Thanks again, {HeroName}. Not just for the information, either. You saved a lot of lives tonight. I guess heroes like you do that a lot, though. <br><br>Well, at least the Sisterhood of the Huntress is pretty equal opportunity. Man or woman, if you're not one of the Knives then they'll find a reason to sacrifice you. Makes me glad I got out of that sorority of killers early."
// RandomFameString :
"P2951170775" "You saved my sister from some kind of crazy moon-cult, {HeroName}. You'll always have my thanks for that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Mission10 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TitanShipping 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4084288134" "Shipping records"
// DetailString :
"P840906081" "You got these shipping labels from shipments of Malta Titan repair parts you destroyed. They've been sent through multiple routes, but enough records might lead you to their point of origin."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1810131431" "I have a little something for you to do. There have been a swarm of shipments building up at a warehouse that have caught my attention. I can't tell you what I think they are or why, but I want the containers intercepted with extreme force before they can be picked up by their owners. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you destroy the shipment for me?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P338277839" "Destroy the mysterious shipment"
// SendOffString :
"P1706254178" "You're so helpful. There should be about 10 crates in all. Each of them should also have a shipping label. I want you to destroy the crates, but keep the labels for me. They could prove very useful for tracking down their source."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P461388926" "Destroy the shipment"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P699627967" "There should be about 10 crates in all. Each of them should also have a shipping label. I want you to destroy the crates, but keep the labels for me. They could prove very useful for tracking down their source."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P823857100" "This warehouse is the place. If Indigo is right, you should find the crates you're looking for, and maybe even their owners."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2978852015" "Opal Blue"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P754693186" "Is the entire shipment here? Those Titans eat spares like popcorn."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3864035507" "This operation just got difficult. We have an MHI! Move, people!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Crates1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3524833866" "Crate"
// Description :
"P1887966270" "crates to destroy"
// SingularDescription :
"P2736611087" "Destroy the last crate!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2315361055" "You begin destroying the crate!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2801557045" "You have destroyed the crate!"
// InteractActionString :
"P3365161279" "Destroying..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3745952211" "This crate was full of spare parts for a Malta Group Titan cyborg!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Crates2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3991292393" "Crate of robot parts"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3228971221" "You destroyed a shipment of spare parts for Malta's Titans."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2066738234" "So it was spare parts for their Titans. I knew it. With these shipping papers, I may be able to get a line on who they're buying spare parts from these days. Thank you, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_KillTask11 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1756239033" "I need you to get and hold the attention of the Malta Group for a little while. Nothing too complicated, just <A HREF={ACCEPT}>fight their agents on the ground in Peregrine Island</A>. They shouldn't be hard to find there, so this should be pretty easy. Aside from all of the fighting and stuff."
// AcceptString :
"P3289322642" "Fight Malta agents in Peregrine Island"
// SendOffString :
"P3907308883" "Thanks! About 45 of them should be enough to hold their attention. Oh, and I should tell you that they might be aware that you're coming, so if were you I'd watch out for an ambush or something."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2338043790" "Combat Malta agents"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2875318271" "Just a few more to go! You're doing great!"
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4040588575" "We've confirmed the target. Moving in."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3410551406" "You've successfully distracted the Malta agents for whatever Indigo was planning."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3632439998" "You're a real life-saver, {HeroName}. I really can't tell you what you did, or how, or why I needed you to do that, but I can tell you that there's 4 senators, an archaeologist, and the pilot of a small plane who owe you their lives. <br><br>4 senators, an archeologist, and a pilot? You know, that sounds like the start of a joke."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_KillTask12 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1921432113" "I can't tell you why I need to ask this or what it's all about, {HeroName}, but I need you to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>cause a bit of a disturbance for Malta's private army around Peregrine Island</A>. Just sort of head over there and crack some heads. You know, make a ruckus. You can make a ruckus, can't you?"
// AcceptString :
"P304499257" "Make a ruckus for Malta forces in Peregrine Island"
// SendOffString :
"P3615233062" "I knew you'd be up for it. Okay, this should be really easy. Just head over to Peregrine Island and look for trouble."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2793986561" "Cause trouble for Malta in Peregrine Island"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2916620328" "Continue making trouble for Malta. They don't know what to think right now!"
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1837427316" "Target is {HeroName}. Approach with caution."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2670420933" "You have caused enough of a ruckus with Malta's private army for the moment."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3464789951" "That was quite informative, {HeroName}. Malta's reaction told me a lot about what they think of you. They're trying hard to keep an eye on your actions, and making interesting assumptions about what you do and don't know. You'll be gratified to know that they regard you as a major threat. If you really can judge a person by their enemies, then you have to be a very good person to know."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_KillTask13 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3941626797" "I have a message from Crimson asking that you quote: '<A HREF={ACCEPT}>Work to reduce the numbers of the Malta operatives deployed in Paragon City</A>', end quote. He didn't give me any more information, but then if he had I probably couldn't pass it on to you anyway. We have to keep our secrets in this kind of thing if we want to stay safe."
// AcceptString :
"P2159299566" "'Work to reduce the numbers of the Malta Operatives deployed in Paragon City'"
// SendOffString :
"P1570342862" "I'll send Crimson word that you agreed to help. He didn't specify any zones of the city in particular, so I guess anywhere is fair game. Good luck."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2271392622" "Battle Malta Operatives"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P967156379" "Crimson has sent along his acknowledgement. Tell me when you're done with his job."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4210656465" "Sisters, strike against {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P261553627" "You've fought enough Malta Operatives to meet Crimson's request."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2943267680" "Crimson asked me to thank you for him. I have a feeling that he was being watched by Malta and needed a distraction. Normally he's much more hands-on in this kind of thing."
